  "id": "overnight-02-timer-remaining",
  "exportName": "remainingTimerSeconds",
  "objective": "Implement pure exported remainingTimerSeconds(deadlineMs:number,nowMs:number):number. Both must be finite nonnegative numbers; throw otherwise. Return Math.max(0,Math.ceil((deadlineMs-nowMs)/1000)). Inputs are caller-supplied absolute timestamps. No time reads, timers, imports, mutation, external resources or public labels. Reached/past deadlines return zero and positive fractional seconds round up.",
